<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=226 valign=top style='width:169.2pt;border:none;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:18.7pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr style='height:17.4pt'>\r\n  <td width=331 valign=top style='width:248.4pt;border:none;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:17.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>ACE\r\n  (Angiotensin Converting Enzyme)<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>(Serum,\r\n  Enzymatic)<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=114 valign=top style='width:85.5pt;border:none;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:17.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>55.82<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=78 valign=top style='width:58.5pt;border:none;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:17.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt'>U\/L<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=226 valign=top style='width:169.2pt;border:none;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:17.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt'>12-68<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr style='height:19.75pt'>\r\n  <td width=331 valign=top style='width:248.4pt;border:none;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:19.75pt'><\/td>\r\n  <td width=114 valign=top style='width:85.5pt;border:none;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:19.75pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=78 valign=top style='width:58.5pt;border:none;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:19.75pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=226 valign=top style='width:169.2pt;border:none;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:19.75pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n<\/table>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>Interpretation <\/span><\/b><b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>: <\/span><\/b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<ol style='margin-top:0cm' start=1 type=1>\r\n <li class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\n     style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>Elevated levels of\r\n     ACE activity occur in serum of patients with active sarcoidosis, and\r\n     occasionally in premature infants with respiratory distress syndrome, in\r\n     adults with tuberculosis, Gauchers disease, leprosy, and in many other\r\n     pathologic conditions involving lung and liver diseases.<\/span><\/li>\r\n<\/ol>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 2.\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>ACE activity is\r\ninhibited by EDTA and by heavy metal ions that may serve to replace the zinc\r\nion of the enzyme.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 3.\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>Upon administration of\r\nthe angiotensin converting enzyme inhibitory drug, ACE serum activity is\r\nmarkedly\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 reduced\r\nbut usually returns to normal levels in about 12hours.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<h4 align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/h4>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span\r\nstyle='position:relative;z-index:251658752;left:-54px;top:442px;width:1052px;\r\nheight:444px'><img width=842 height=2 src=\"data:image\/gif;base64,R0lGODlhHAQCAHcAMSH+GlNvZnR3YXJlOiBNaWNyb3NvZnQgT2ZmaWNlACH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAAcBAIAgAAAAAAAAAJIBHKJq83vIpyy0msz3rrz74XgKJbkaaboqrbs68bwLNf0bef4rvf87wsCh8KaoUhMIpfKJvPpjEKn0ir1as1it9ou9+sNNwAFADs=\"><\/span><b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<br clear=ALL>\r\n\r\n<h4 align=center style='text-align:center'><u><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>DEPARTMENT OF PATHOLOGY<\/span><\/u><\/h4>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><u><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>ANGIOTENSIN\r\nCONVERTING ENZYME (ACE)<\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<table class=MsoNormalTable border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 align=left\r\n width=749 style='width:561.6pt;border-collapse:collapse;border:none;\r\n margin-left:6.75pt;margin-right:6.75pt'>\r\n <tr style='height:18.7pt'>\r\n  <td width=331 valign=top style='width:248.4pt;border:none;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:18.7pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\r\n  \"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Test Name<\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=114 valign=top style='width:85.5pt;border:none;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:18.7pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><u><span\r\n  lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Results<\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=78 valign=top style='width:58.5pt;border:none;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:18.7pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><u><span\r\n  lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Unit<\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=226 valign=top style='width:169.2pt;border:none;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:18.7pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\r\n  \"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Bio. Ref. Interval<\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr style='height:18.7pt'>\r\n  <td width=331 valign=top style='width:248.4pt;border:none;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:18.7pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=114 valign=top style='width:85.5pt;border:none;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:18.7pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=78 valign=top style='width:58.5pt;border:none;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:18.7pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=226 valign=top style='width:169.2pt;border:none;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:18.7pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr style='height:17.4pt'>\r\n  <td width=331 valign=top style='width:248.4pt;border:none;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:17.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n  \"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>ACE\u00a0 [Angiotensin Converting Enzyme]<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=114 valign=top style='width:85.5pt;border:none;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:17.4pt'><\/td>\r\n  <td width=78 valign=top style='width:58.5pt;border:none;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:17.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt'>U\/L<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=226 valign=top style='width:169.2pt;border:none;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:17.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt'>8.00 \u2013 65.0 <\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr style='height:19.75pt'>\r\n  <td width=331 valign=top style='width:248.4pt;border:none;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:19.75pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>Methodology : Spectrophotometry<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=114 valign=top style='width:85.5pt;border:none;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:19.75pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=78 valign=top style='width:58.5pt;border:none;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:19.75pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=226 valign=top style='width:169.2pt;border:none;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:19.75pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n<\/table>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>COMMENT<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Angiotensin \u2013 converting enzyme\r\n(ACE) is an enzyme that helps regulate blood pressure. It modulates peripheral\r\nvascular resistance as well as renal and cardiovascular function. It is\r\nresponsible for conversion of Angiotensin II as well as inactivation of\r\nbreadykinin. Majority of ACE is tissue bound (&gt;90%) found predominantly in\r\nlungs &amp; testes. An increased blood pressure level of ACE is sometimes found\r\nin Sarcoidosis, a systemic disorder of unknown cause that often affects the\r\nlungs but may also affect many other body organ, including the eyes, skin,\r\nnerves, liver and heart.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>A classic features of Sarcoidosis\r\nis the development of granulomas, small tumor \u2013 like masses of immune and\r\ninflammatory cells and fibrous tissue that form nodules under the skin and in\r\norgans throughout the body. Granulomas change the structure of the tissue\r\naround them and in sufficient numbers, they can cause damage and inflammation\r\nand may interface with normal functions. The cells found at the outside borders\r\nof granulomas can produce increased amounts of ACE. The level of ACE in the\r\nblood may increase when Sarcoidosis \u2013 related granulomas develop.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Factor affecting Angiotensin \u2013\r\nconverting enzyme (ACE)<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>- Generally, serum levels in\r\nchildren are substantially higher and more variable than in adults<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>- ACE activity levels in newborns\r\nare very low<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>- Smoking \u2013 ACE activity is 30%\r\nlower in smokers<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>- Patients taking ACE inhibitors,\r\nsuch as captopril and enalapril will have extremely low or unmeasurable ACE\r\nactivity. <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<\/div>","page":{"size":"612.0pt 792.0pt","margin":"148.5pt 90.0pt 72.0pt 31.5pt"}}